---
description: Prepare one verifySynthesis evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: ConsultationResponseOption[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Audit the synthesis against sampled submissions and all identified minority themes, reconcile exact counts, and prepare an accessible report. Preserve methodological limitations and provide traceable examples without exposing unnecessary personal information. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
